<Layout
  id={false}
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy and data protection information for this website"
>
  <p>
    This website does not collect, store, or process any personal data. No
    cookies are set, and no analytics, tracking pixels, advertising, or other
    third-party services are used.
  </p>

  <h2>Data collection on this website</h2>
  <p>
    This website is a static site. There are no user accounts, contact forms,
    comment functions, or newsletter subscriptions. No personal data is
    requested or stored by this website.
  </p>

  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>
    This website is hosted via Cloudflare Pages. When you access the site, the
    hosting provider may process technically necessary connection data (such as
    your IP address) in server logs for security and operational purposes. This
    processing is carried out by Cloudflare, Inc. and is outside the control of
    this website. For more information, please refer to the
    <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/"
      >Cloudflare Privacy Policy</a
    >.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights under the GDPR</h2>
  <p>
    Since this website does not collect or process personal data, there is
    generally no personal data held about you in connection with this website.
    Nevertheless, you have the following rights under the General Data
    Protection Regulation (GDPR):
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Right of access (Art. 15 GDPR)</li>
    <li>Right to rectification (Art. 16 GDPR)</li>
    <li>Right to erasure (Art. 17 GDPR)</li>
    <li>Right to restriction of processing (Art. 18 GDPR)</li>
    <li>Right to data portability (Art. 20 GDPR)</li>
    <li>Right to object (Art. 21 GDPR)</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    You also have the right to lodge a complaint with a data protection
    supervisory authority (Art. 77 GDPR).
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this privacy policy</h2>
  <p>
    This privacy policy may be updated to reflect changes to the website or
    legal requirements. The version published on this page is the current one.
  </p>
</Layout>
